---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Latent trajectories"
  title="One observed example corresponds to many possible paths"
  caption="Reconstructed from the image-to-noise paths on page 41. The layout is turned vertically so the state labels remain readable on narrow screens. Three schematic trajectories illustrate different latent states; they are neither recorded samples nor an exhaustive list. The forward distribution q supplies paths for the bound, while the observation likelihood integrates the model joint over every unobserved state x₁ through x_T."
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 340 450" role="img" aria-labelledby="ddpm-trajectories-title ddpm-trajectories-desc">
    <title id="ddpm-trajectories-title">A fixed clean observation can be associated with many noising trajectories</title>
    <desc id="ddpm-trajectories-desc">The known observation x zero branches into three illustrative paths through different states at time one, an intermediate timestep and the terminal noisy timestep T. Arrows point in the forward noising direction. To evaluate the model likelihood of x zero, integrate the reverse model joint over all latent states x one through x T. The forward density supplies trajectories for the variational expectation. No points represent measured samples.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ddpm-trajectory-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="head" /></marker>
      <marker id="ddpm-trajectory-accent-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="accent-head" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="170" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="panel-title">One x₀, many latent trajectories</text>
    <text x="170" y="50" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Possible forward paths under q</text>
    <rect x="100" y="72" width="140" height="42" rx="5" class="observation" />
    <text x="170" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="symbol">known x₀</text>
    <g class="path" marker-end="url(#ddpm-trajectory-head)">
      <path d="M 155 120 L 104 160" />
      <path d="M 185 120 L 236 160" />
      <path d="M 100 185 L 83 248" />
      <path d="M 240 185 L 257 248" />
      <path d="M 80 277 L 93 333" />
      <path d="M 260 277 L 273 333" />
    </g>
    <g class="accent-path" marker-end="url(#ddpm-trajectory-accent-head)">
      <path d="M 170 120 V 158" />
      <path d="M 170 185 V 201" />
      <path d="M 170 234 V 248" />
      <path d="M 174 277 L 205 333" />
    </g>
    <g class="latent">
      <circle cx="100" cy="175" r="8" /><circle cx="240" cy="175" r="8" />
      <circle cx="80" cy="265" r="8" /><circle cx="260" cy="265" r="8" />
      <circle cx="95" cy="350" r="8" /><circle cx="275" cy="350" r="8" />
    </g>
    <g class="accent-latent">
      <circle cx="170" cy="175" r="8" /><circle cx="170" cy="265" r="8" /><circle cx="210" cy="350" r="8" />
    </g>
    <text x="28" y="180" class="symbol">x₁</text>
    <text x="28" y="270" class="symbol">x<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">t</tspan></text>
    <text x="28" y="355" class="symbol">x<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">T</tspan></text>
    <text x="170" y="225" text-anchor="middle" class="ellipsis">⋮</text>
    <text x="170" y="313" text-anchor="middle" class="ellipsis">⋮</text>
    <text x="170" y="399" text-anchor="middle" class="formula">Integrate over x₁, …, x<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">T</tspan></text>
    <text x="170" y="426" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">to evaluate the model likelihood p<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">θ</tspan>(x₀).</text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 420px; margin-inline: auto; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 16px; }
  .panel-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .muted { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .symbol, .formula { font-size: 18px; }
  .subscript { font-size: 12px; }
  .ellipsis { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 22px; }
  .observation { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .latent { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .accent-latent { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .path, .head { fill: none; stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .accent-path, .accent-head { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
</style>
